old the small plane crashed into one of the buildings, but we didn`t know any details other than that.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: What happened?\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: The roof, something came to collapse. I need some water.\par \par \uc2 (CROSSTALK)\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: What happened?\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: The building collapse, one of the building collapses.\par \par \uc2 WEITZ: It got immensely quiet after the first tower fell. And I remember law enforcement and fire fighters telling us to stay back. Mark said, wait here, and he ran in\par \par \uc2 (CROSSTALK)\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: There is a woman in a wheelchair, and I got her into strap wheelchair and just carried her down the steps and character her down, 68 floors man.\par \par \uc2 LAGANGA: After the first building came down, there`s very little color in anything that you`re looking at. Even the shrubs and the greenery is all parade.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: Do you know where everybody`s going?\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: No, I don`t.\par \par \uc2 WEITZ: I remember the crackling of the fire, looking up at the second tower. And then I remember as it started to come down.\par \par \uc2 LAGANGA: It sounded like jets were flying overhead, so I just tilt it up to see them to videotape them, and it wasn`t jets, it was, the tower was coming down. I knew the smoke was coming towards me, but the reason you know, turn and drop the camera run away as you`re there to document what happens. What happened?\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: It collapse. The top floors collapse down. I saw a prop flow, and then ran like health. I got 69, but I can still run. It`s going to be fine to trap back.\par \par \uc2 WEITZ: When the second tower fell, I thought that LaGanga had probably bought it. That was it. And I was thinking about having to speak with his wife about that. But I remained hopeful and I move forward to find him. And at some point, Mark came walking out